# T9 — quit mid-task, then `workshop -c` and continue
@timeout 900
launch mkdir -p ~/myproject && cd ~/myproject && workshop
type build a command line todo app in python: todo.py with add, list and done commands, saving the todos in todos.json. test it when you're done
waitre ◆  180
sleep 2
key C-c
sleep 2
line /exit
waitshell 30
snap after-quit
line clear
sleep 1
line workshop -c
waitre build a command line todo app 10
sleep 3
type please continue where you left off
waitturn
line /exit
waitshell 30
